          "quote": "The average atomic radius mismatches of (ZrTiNb)100-xTax are similar (~0.036). However, their average shear modulus mismatches increase correspondingly from 0.13 to 0.24 with the increase in Ta content. It is evident that the increase in yield strength is primarily attributed to solid solution strengthening induced by shear modulus mismatch.",
